Description: Zero-config AI context generation and code quality toolkit with Claude Code Agent Mode
 PMAT (Pragmatic AI MCP Agent Toolkit) is a zero-configuration AI context
 generation system with extreme quality enforcement and Toyota Way standards.
 .
 Key Features:
 - Claude Code Agent Mode for continuous quality monitoring
 - AI context generation optimized for LLM workflows
 - Code complexity analysis with McCabe cyclomatic & cognitive complexity
 - Technical debt detection (SATD) with severity classification
 - Quality gates with Toyota Way ≤20 complexity enforcement
 - Multi-language support for 30+ languages via tree-sitter
 - Real-time file system monitoring with instant feedback
 - Production-ready systemd service deployment
 .
 The package includes MCP (Model Context Protocol) integration for seamless
 Claude Code experience, providing 6 agent-specific tools plus 18 existing
 analysis capabilities.
